King James (Authorized) Version, 1769 standardised text, protocanon only,
with Strong's numbers added.

Public Domain. Letters patent issued by King James mean that printing this
translation in the United Kingdom, or importing printed copies into the UK,
requires permission from the Crown's patentees (Cambridge University Press,
Oxford University Press, Collins). This has no effect outside the UK.

